00:33:30.990 --> 00:33:32.170
The Gaimelf of the Isparno family.

00:33:33.050 --> 00:33:41.200
What did you do?

00:33:41.460 --> 00:33:42.380
I called them.

00:33:42.760 --> 00:33:43.140
Who?

00:33:43.500 --> 00:33:45.340
The Isparno family who created the Escaflowne.

00:34:19.836 --> 00:34:22.176
So this is the rumored Hispano-Cobo War.

00:34:31.310 --> 00:34:33.410
You're going to pay for this, aren't you?

00:34:33.410 --> 00:34:39.800
I'll tell you, Gerson.

00:34:40.040 --> 00:34:40.720
Rude!

00:34:46.450 --> 00:34:46.610
Oh!

00:34:46.870 --> 00:34:47.310
Oh!

00:34:49.990 --> 00:34:51.480
Escaflowne!

00:34:51.580 --> 00:34:51.980
Oh!

00:34:52.560 --> 00:34:54.210
Escaflowne!

00:34:54.210 --> 00:34:55.840
Are you okay?

00:34:57.160 --> 00:34:58.040
I've confirmed Escaflowne.

00:35:04.990 --> 00:35:05.430
50 million.

00:35:05.610 --> 00:35:07.300
Ten million?

00:35:08.200 --> 00:35:09.840
The repair fee for Escaflowne.

00:35:09.900 --> 00:35:11.640
Our pay?

00:35:12.660 --> 00:35:13.460
2000 years!

00:35:13.740 --> 00:35:14.120
What?

00:35:16.020 --> 00:35:18.670
If you don't pay, we'll pay.

00:35:18.890 --> 00:35:23.740
I'll pay.

00:35:24.550 --> 00:35:25.410
Young master!

00:35:25.810 --> 00:35:27.300
I'll give you the whole thousand bullets.

00:35:28.100 --> 00:35:28.700
How about that?

00:35:30.860 --> 00:35:32.180
I've been resting for five years.

00:35:33.240 --> 00:35:35.280
The total amount is 80 million.

00:35:37.180 --> 00:35:41.420
Dryden, we don't want to pay back that kind of money.

00:35:42.850 --> 00:35:44.850
It's a big deal to be so obsessed with the royal family.

00:35:45.000 --> 00:35:48.080
Don't say such things. I just like that king.

00:36:27.870 --> 00:36:29.960
I'll take care of it, I'll take care of it

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:30.640
The pain of Escaflowne...

00:36:31.110 --> 00:36:33.470
Mr. Dryden?

00:36:33.790 --> 00:36:34.690
It's all right.

00:36:34.830 --> 00:36:38.680
After the repair of Escaflowne, the King's wounds will heal.

00:36:38.920 --> 00:36:41.530
If I can endure this pain...

00:36:41.530 --> 00:36:51.540
And...

00:36:51.540 --> 00:36:56.460
By the way...

00:37:00.860 --> 00:37:03.420
It's okay, Top Hamerun, right?

00:38:01.436 --> 00:38:04.436
This is the heart of the ideal future

00:38:25.660 --> 00:38:27.660
There's only one wound left.

00:38:28.636 --> 00:38:29.136
Yuka!

00:38:32.270 --> 00:38:33.960
Meruru, I'm worried about you.

00:38:34.970 --> 00:38:36.810
I didn't expect you to really get better.

00:38:37.960 --> 00:38:38.400
Oops.

00:38:38.740 --> 00:38:40.430
It's all thanks to everyone.

00:38:40.650 --> 00:38:44.980
Thank you, Allen. You saved me again.

00:38:45.160 --> 00:38:47.820
If you're going to thank me, you should thank Dryden and Hitomi.

00:38:48.270 --> 00:38:53.360
No, it's all thanks to this young lady.

00:38:54.080 --> 00:38:55.270
Hitomi...

00:38:56.290 --> 00:38:59.090
Burn, be careful of Escaflowne.

00:39:00.670 --> 00:39:02.370
No, I don't think we should ride anymore.

00:39:03.170 --> 00:39:07.610
If Escaflowne gets hurt, it'll be the same thing again.

00:39:07.770 --> 00:39:12.760
If... If we break Escaflowne, Pan will also...

00:39:12.760 --> 00:39:15.260
I won't hurt Escaflowne!

00:39:15.740 --> 00:39:17.000
Pan...

00:39:17.000 --> 00:39:19.900
The warriors are coming.

00:39:20.650 --> 00:39:21.830
It's not about Pan.

00:39:22.030 --> 00:39:23.580
You guys will leave.

00:39:24.100 --> 00:39:25.240
You're so stupid.

00:39:25.540 --> 00:39:27.060
Boss, it's already...

00:39:27.060 --> 00:39:28.640
Let's go, Allen!

00:39:31.240 --> 00:39:31.900
My contract

00:39:33.240 --> 00:39:33.680
Contract

00:39:40.420 --> 00:39:42.210
Use the dragon's blood

00:39:42.210 --> 00:39:43.480
Pano

00:39:43.480 --> 00:39:44.080
Can you guarantee?

00:39:44.560 --> 00:39:47.420
I can't guarantee

00:39:47.420 --> 00:39:56.490
You ran away to a faraway place

00:40:09.000 --> 00:40:11.250
Don't say that! This is a challenge!

00:40:11.570 --> 00:40:12.600
It's like a decoration.

00:40:13.880 --> 00:40:24.400
Leave it to us!

00:40:24.540 --> 00:40:26.420
I'm not the one who can win with Amelef!

00:40:26.700 --> 00:40:28.500
Listen to what I have to say!

00:40:30.120 --> 00:40:30.600
I told you!

00:40:30.820 --> 00:40:31.880
I can't guarantee it!

00:40:32.380 --> 00:40:33.680
Don't ride Escaflowne!

00:40:34.400 --> 00:40:34.840
Eva!

00:40:39.990 --> 00:40:40.290
Mom!

00:40:40.940 --> 00:40:45.240
I can use Escaflowne!

00:41:35.690 --> 00:41:37.980
You guys, I'll finish the dragon hunting today.

00:41:39.280 --> 00:41:51.460
I'll kick you with my own hands.

00:41:51.520 --> 00:41:54.150
Ezuka, Flowne, give me the shell!

00:43:01.050 --> 00:43:01.690
I'll avenge you!

00:43:01.990 --> 00:43:16.870
What the hell is he doing?

00:43:30.670 --> 00:43:33.370
I'm sorry.

00:43:33.670 --> 00:43:34.190
Sister!

00:43:34.580 --> 00:43:35.160
I'm sorry!

00:44:04.320 --> 00:44:04.560
Attack!

00:44:30.480 --> 00:44:32.420
You should come with us.

00:44:32.770 --> 00:44:33.790
Who are you?

00:44:33.810 --> 00:44:36.660
D-Lantern-sama is with us.

00:44:37.040 --> 00:44:38.470
Please grant us your power and our power.

00:44:41.620 --> 00:44:45.440
We chose you to be our leader, but we won't let you kill us.

00:44:45.840 --> 00:44:47.260
You guys are...

00:44:48.910 --> 00:44:49.790
Yorra!

00:46:38.380 --> 00:46:39.100
Scarecrow

00:48:01.276 --> 00:48:02.276
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:50:01.790 --> 00:50:01.970
Thank you.

00:51:04.320 --> 00:51:04.620
Thank you.

00:51:45.070 --> 00:51:47.340
It's not heaven, is it?

00:52:33.450 --> 00:52:35.350
Ban, let's go home.

00:52:35.390 --> 00:52:41.010
I'm waiting for you.

00:54:00.960 --> 00:54:01.740
I'll bring you back!

00:54:02.340 --> 00:54:03.710
Hey! Are you listening?

00:54:06.620 --> 00:54:28.640
Hey! Stop!

00:55:02.240 --> 00:55:02.480
Uh-huh!

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:35.260
Lulu, it's all thanks to you.

00:55:40.980 --> 00:55:45.620
They're all incompetent.

00:55:46.140 --> 00:55:51.400
Gimel, Dalet, Shester, Gertie, Viore...

00:55:51.400 --> 00:55:55.960
If we lose our lives in a fight like this, it won't be worth it.

00:56:31.930 --> 00:56:34.870
I have obtained the Power Spot thanks to the Blade Advertisement.

00:56:36.220 --> 00:56:37.140
However...

00:56:37.140 --> 00:56:38.370
Are you a dragon?

00:56:39.190 --> 00:56:40.760
Yes, I am.

00:56:40.980 --> 00:56:45.200
The fate of a dragon lies in the mist, or rather, in the mist.

00:56:46.040 --> 00:56:48.350
Leave it to me.

00:56:49.240 --> 00:56:50.520
I have already taken the next step.

00:56:51.420 --> 00:56:52.930
Capture the dragon!

00:57:30.350 --> 00:57:31.670
My hands are shaking because I'm holding a sword!

00:57:31.830 --> 00:57:38.450
Grandma...

00:57:38.450 --> 00:57:40.700
I'm not worried about Burn.

00:57:40.980 --> 00:57:43.840
But, ever since then, he's been like that...

00:57:43.840 --> 00:57:47.180
A trial that a swordsman must overcome.

00:57:48.000 --> 00:57:48.560
What?

00:57:48.940 --> 00:57:51.930
I remember it, too.

00:57:51.930 --> 00:57:56.250
Unebore and arrogance invite me into the fog of fear.

00:57:58.730 --> 00:57:59.870
Soon, the swordsman...

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:02.100
You're the one who's challenging your opponent, aren't you?

00:58:03.120 --> 00:58:08.150
Heh! If you're afraid to fight me, leave all your money behind!

00:58:08.470 --> 00:58:10.110
If you do that, I'll save your life!

00:58:11.030 --> 00:58:15.460
Let me hear your name so that I can remember you a little better.

00:58:16.290 --> 00:58:17.170
Alen Shezar!

00:58:17.390 --> 00:58:18.880
Kobu!

00:58:18.880 --> 00:58:19.600
Haa!

00:58:19.740 --> 00:58:29.030
You're good at fighting, but you're too good at fighting.

00:58:30.440 --> 00:58:31.460
I can't see the light.

00:58:32.270 --> 00:58:34.430
Kill me! Kill me!

00:58:35.210 --> 00:58:37.760
Why are you in a hurry to die?

00:58:38.780 --> 00:58:40.540
I don't have a family or a home, but I have all the swords.

00:58:41.160 --> 00:58:43.220
I can't live without them!

00:58:43.300 --> 00:58:46.520
The sword is not a power, nor a skill.

00:58:47.100 --> 00:58:49.180
The true technique is within you.

00:58:50.140 --> 00:58:52.290
Train yourself.

00:58:53.910 --> 00:58:54.950
That is my death.

00:58:55.660 --> 00:58:56.520
The encounter with Lord Vargas.

00:58:56.960 --> 00:58:58.900
To me, who is exhausted.

00:59:00.250 --> 00:59:01.630
Death showed me the light.

00:59:01.650 --> 00:59:04.090
Sword is to polish oneself.

00:59:05.220 --> 00:59:07.820
But I'm still not close to death.

00:59:08.000 --> 00:59:09.340
I...

00:59:11.030 --> 00:59:11.590
That's not true.

00:59:12.230 --> 00:59:18.270
Allen is good looking, strong, kind, and...

00:59:18.270 --> 00:59:22.340
I don't know much about swords.

00:59:22.740 --> 00:59:26.200
I don't think he'll listen to me, but...

00:59:26.200 --> 00:59:28.640
I'm sure Allen will...

00:59:30.760 --> 00:59:37.740
Because you're wonderful, and everyone admires you, and I like you, and...

00:59:38.090 --> 00:59:42.380
Please take care of me!

00:59:43.100 --> 00:59:51.020
You look like a devil as time goes by, Hitomi.

00:59:58.840 --> 00:59:59.840
An illusionary moon...

01:00:00.190 --> 01:00:02.190
The mysterious underground of the eyes.

01:00:03.520 --> 01:00:08.460
Burn, Escaflowne, who draws the blood of the dragon people.

01:00:09.570 --> 01:00:10.790
And Zaibach, who is aiming for the power spot.

01:00:12.230 --> 01:00:14.240
A strange event that keeps appearing.

01:00:15.960 --> 01:00:18.780
Ah, Kosubayoi.

01:00:19.000 --> 01:00:20.220
Something's going to get caught.

01:00:20.600 --> 01:00:25.630
Um, Dryden, thank you.

01:00:26.210 --> 01:00:26.550
What?

01:00:26.870 --> 01:00:29.880
If it's a car accident...

01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:32.470
I don't need it. It's just a matter of lowering my head.

01:00:33.270 --> 01:00:38.760
That's the way you say it. I was going to look at you again and apologize for all the bad things you've done so far.

01:00:40.400 --> 01:00:45.540
That's it. That's definitely more like you.

01:00:45.800 --> 01:00:50.910
Of course, I have a conscience, and I'll do anything to be careful.

01:00:51.250 --> 01:00:54.010
But I...

01:00:54.010 --> 01:00:59.870
Aren't you? I don't care. I want what I want.

01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:01.020
I'm sure I'll get it.

01:01:01.580 --> 01:01:07.470
Well, it's fine.

01:01:07.570 --> 01:01:10.260
I don't want to say it in return, but...

01:01:10.260 --> 01:01:12.910
I have a favor to ask of you.

01:01:13.270 --> 01:01:13.670
What?

01:01:14.480 --> 01:01:18.220
It's the last paper that was left in the book.

01:01:20.480 --> 01:01:22.030
Oh, this, this.

01:01:22.450 --> 01:01:24.260
Is this useful?

01:01:25.320 --> 01:01:26.580
It is, it is.

01:01:26.940 --> 01:01:29.400
Now all the mysteries about you are...

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:30.860
It may be solved.

01:01:30.860 --> 01:01:31.930
A mystery?

01:01:32.210 --> 01:01:33.570
It's Atlantis.

01:01:34.530 --> 01:01:35.170
Atlantis?

01:01:36.110 --> 01:01:38.150
Your father told me about the secret of Atlantis.

01:01:39.290 --> 01:01:41.260
My father told me a lot about it.

01:01:41.860 --> 01:01:44.260
Oh, I borrowed this for a while.

01:01:44.580 --> 01:01:48.350
He's a very famous person.

01:01:49.230 --> 01:01:50.350
I'm ashamed of myself for being in such a strange land.

01:01:52.960 --> 01:01:57.390
It's cheaper than Escaflowne's repair fee.

01:02:00.350 --> 01:02:01.890
Yes, that's true.

01:02:08.150 --> 01:02:11.480
I guess I'll go there.

01:02:12.000 --> 01:02:17.150
This is just a prostitute, isn't it?

01:02:17.370 --> 01:02:25.240
Irana-san, I have some advice for my friend.

01:02:26.860 --> 01:02:27.200
Yes.

01:02:30.570 --> 01:02:36.040
There is a man who is dating that girl, but it seems that he found out that she was a playboy and was a hidden child.

01:02:37.640 --> 01:02:38.140
What?

01:02:38.360 --> 01:02:39.590
That's terrible.

01:02:39.910 --> 01:02:41.290
Listen to me.

01:02:41.510 --> 01:02:42.010
Yes.

01:02:42.750 --> 01:02:49.150
It seems that there is another man who is rich and kind, but he said he likes her.

01:02:49.930 --> 01:02:50.780
Yes, yes.

01:02:50.880 --> 01:02:53.430
Isn't that obvious? That idiot.

01:02:53.870 --> 01:02:54.150
So?

01:02:57.170 --> 01:02:59.650
What should I do with that girl?

01:03:00.890 --> 01:03:07.770
What do you mean? If I knew that you were hiding the fact that you had a child, I wouldn't have listened to you, would I?

01:03:07.830 --> 01:03:09.000
Why not?

01:03:09.300 --> 01:03:11.170
Because you can't even compare yourself to a man's hair.

01:03:12.590 --> 01:03:14.010
If you're a woman, you can be anyone.

01:03:14.630 --> 01:03:17.230
But he's a wonderful person.

01:03:17.710 --> 01:03:19.490
Isn't the other one like that?

01:03:19.990 --> 01:03:22.250
I wonder if he passed the exam.

01:03:22.530 --> 01:03:25.300
On top of that, he has love and economic power, right?

01:03:25.680 --> 01:03:27.510
Then it's decided there, isn't it?

01:03:27.590 --> 01:03:28.200
It's obvious.

01:03:28.800 --> 01:03:29.120
Bye.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:31.440
Why don't you just give up without losing?

01:03:31.720 --> 01:03:32.570
How about that?

01:03:33.110 --> 01:03:35.250
Why don't you just give up on both of them?

01:03:35.870 --> 01:03:37.750
A tragic heroine!

01:03:37.810 --> 01:03:38.410
No way!

01:03:39.260 --> 01:03:40.900
But...

01:03:40.900 --> 01:03:44.140
What about the feelings she's been raising up until now?

01:03:45.160 --> 01:03:47.380
So that's the problem after all.

01:03:47.420 --> 01:03:48.990
In any case,

01:03:49.230 --> 01:03:52.550
it's the most natural thing to follow your own feelings.

01:03:53.190 --> 01:03:55.350
My own feelings...

01:03:55.350 --> 01:03:56.280
Let's see.

01:03:57.100 --> 01:03:57.600
Eh?

01:03:57.780 --> 01:03:59.540
Which one of you is in love with that girl?

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:05.040
Don't be silly. What's a fortune-telling?

01:04:05.300 --> 01:04:09.690
Why don't you make your feelings clear before you make a fortune-telling?

01:04:09.850 --> 01:04:11.740
My feelings?

01:04:12.180 --> 01:04:13.740
Which do you like, Mr. Byrne or Mr. Allen?

01:04:14.960 --> 01:04:15.680
Huh?

01:04:31.050 --> 01:04:33.280
What I like is you, Allen.

01:04:33.880 --> 01:04:37.810
I'm just worried about you, Burn.

01:04:37.810 --> 01:04:41.280
I'm really worried about you.

01:04:41.500 --> 01:04:45.000
Then don't come any closer to Burn.

01:04:45.000 --> 01:04:46.240
I can't be with you.

01:04:47.000 --> 01:04:49.790
I don't care.

01:04:51.200 --> 01:04:52.320
Sis, you know what?

01:04:52.760 --> 01:04:54.560
I can't believe we can meet here.

01:04:54.900 --> 01:04:58.690
This is our luck.

01:05:00.280 --> 01:05:01.420
Let's say hello to Mr. Falken for a souvenir.

01:05:02.800 --> 01:05:03.820
That's a good idea.

01:05:03.900 --> 01:05:16.680
What if he finds out about us?

01:05:16.680 --> 01:05:17.660
That's a bad idea!

01:05:19.230 --> 01:05:22.620
There's an external force called Eschatron here.

01:05:22.860 --> 01:05:25.550
We have to ask them to get out of here as soon as possible.

01:05:26.030 --> 01:05:28.560
They're all dead.

01:05:31.080 --> 01:05:31.520
I'm sorry!

01:05:31.800 --> 01:05:33.020
It's the cyber!

01:05:33.540 --> 01:05:34.900
The cyber Gynelph!

01:05:35.240 --> 01:05:35.580
What?

01:05:35.990 --> 01:05:37.720
I'm sorry!

01:05:41.200 --> 01:05:41.360
Alright!

01:06:01.500 --> 01:06:02.100
Burn's coming out!

01:06:02.360 --> 01:06:05.460
Let's get out of here and put an end to this!

01:07:11.230 --> 01:07:11.390
All right.

01:08:01.020 --> 01:08:02.180
That's about it for today.

01:08:02.280 --> 01:08:16.940
Merola!

01:08:41.600 --> 01:08:43.820
Hahaha...

01:08:43.820 --> 01:08:45.860
Hahahaha...

01:08:45.860 --> 01:08:47.900
Hahaha...

01:08:47.900 --> 01:08:50.160
I...I got it!

01:08:50.300 --> 01:08:52.780
As I thought, all the mysteries...

01:08:52.780 --> 01:08:54.340
are in the valley of illusion!

01:09:09.720 --> 01:09:10.560
Aboroshi no Tani?

01:09:10.720 --> 01:09:12.320
It's a legendary place where Ryujin people live.

01:09:36.810 --> 01:09:37.430
I'm not.

01:10:04.890 --> 01:10:05.450
I don't give a fuck

01:10:34.316 --> 01:10:35.316
Skafron

01:10:36.012 --> 01:10:37.012
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

01:10:37.708 --> 01:10:40.708
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

01:13:01.340 --> 01:13:09.520
How are you doing over there?

01:13:10.000 --> 01:13:15.500
The training has been completed without any delay.

01:13:16.110 --> 01:13:16.590
Good.

01:13:18.860 --> 01:13:21.780
I came with the magicians.

01:13:21.780 --> 01:13:22.690
What about the magicians?

01:13:24.280 --> 01:13:29.840
In order to bring back D'Landu, they cut the magicians into pieces.

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:32.700
I don't know what you hate and what you know.

01:13:33.160 --> 01:13:36.170
It's because I'm jealous of you.

01:13:36.550 --> 01:13:39.240
I hate you too.

01:13:39.520 --> 01:13:42.360
You can't say that about me.

01:13:43.620 --> 01:13:46.850
I'm also a demon.

01:13:47.210 --> 01:13:49.700
I'm sorry.

01:13:50.180 --> 01:13:54.270
I'm so lonely.

01:13:54.890 --> 01:13:57.040
I hope we can meet again someday.

01:14:00.220 --> 01:14:00.640
I'm sorry.

01:14:00.900 --> 01:14:06.260
Lend your power to this Falken.

01:14:06.820 --> 01:14:08.810
I understand.

01:14:09.290 --> 01:14:13.940
For the sake of this body and this heart, for Lord Falken's sake.

01:14:16.620 --> 01:14:17.720
Well, I'm in trouble.

01:14:18.320 --> 01:14:21.320
I was in trouble when I realized that it was written in the letters of the Moon of Illusion.

01:14:23.500 --> 01:14:25.520
The Moon of Illusion?

01:14:26.060 --> 01:14:27.150
I got it!

01:14:27.470 --> 01:14:28.290
Stop it!

01:14:28.990 --> 01:14:29.640
Seriously...

01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:31.620
We'll be in trouble if we get caught by the court.

01:14:31.980 --> 01:14:35.940
You should go home.

01:14:36.080 --> 01:14:36.440
Huh?

01:14:37.120 --> 01:14:40.170
I'm going to the village of phantoms from now on.

01:14:41.170 --> 01:14:43.780
You should go back to the palace on this ship.

01:14:44.300 --> 01:14:44.520
What?

01:14:44.700 --> 01:14:44.980
Ah!

01:14:46.860 --> 01:14:48.600
I'll make you pay for your sins, young master!

01:14:49.380 --> 01:14:51.410
I'm not a young master!

01:14:51.650 --> 01:14:53.350
I'll write you a letter.

01:14:54.390 --> 01:14:56.440
Just say that you're with Princess Milano.

01:14:58.000 --> 01:14:59.660
Dryden!

01:15:00.220 --> 01:15:00.720
I'll go.

01:15:00.810 --> 01:15:01.970
You'll go.

01:15:02.450 --> 01:15:03.490
Allen will go.

01:15:04.630 --> 01:15:05.890
Why do I have to go?

01:15:07.120 --> 01:15:08.200
You have to come.

01:15:09.060 --> 01:15:15.500
Your father abandoned his house, his property, and his family to find an illusion village.

01:15:16.040 --> 01:15:19.780
It's a famous story in Astoria.

01:15:19.780 --> 01:15:21.730
I know it too.

01:15:21.830 --> 01:15:25.560
Allen's father.

01:15:26.200 --> 01:15:28.140
I want to go too.

01:15:28.140 --> 01:15:29.670
It's an illusion.

01:15:30.030 --> 01:15:34.610
I want to see the origin of the dragon's blood that flows through my body.

01:15:36.130 --> 01:15:39.180
The mystery of the relationship between that blood and Escaflowne.

01:15:41.850 --> 01:15:44.860
What kind of yin and yang are you?

01:15:46.040 --> 01:15:49.080
You are a person involved in an illusion valley.

01:15:49.560 --> 01:15:56.380
The northern city of Suisho.

01:15:56.380 --> 01:15:58.320
The green moon of the 12th.

01:15:58.320 --> 01:15:58.620
Next

01:16:00.000 --> 01:16:04.480
We are heading to the dark continent of Asgard, where no one has ever been before.

01:16:04.900 --> 01:16:08.640
Yes, the valley of phantoms must be there.

01:16:09.280 --> 01:16:14.810
If you go there, you will find the power to create a miracle that you have been looking for for years.

01:16:15.690 --> 01:16:18.740
Yes, the power of Atlantis.

01:16:19.680 --> 01:16:24.420
It won't work!

01:16:24.880 --> 01:16:27.200
It's impossible to land on the island in this storm!

01:16:27.900 --> 01:16:29.640
Captain, we're in trouble!

01:16:30.160 --> 01:16:31.300
Enagis' fever won't go down!

01:16:31.580 --> 01:16:34.360
Hey, it's the curse of the dragon!

01:16:34.740 --> 01:16:36.850
This sea is a place where people shouldn't come!

01:16:37.430 --> 01:16:40.780
Guys, let's return the ship!

01:16:41.460 --> 01:16:41.780
Hey!

01:16:42.240 --> 01:16:43.440
Get out!

01:16:43.780 --> 01:16:45.400
The promise is wrong.

01:16:45.860 --> 01:16:47.780
I'll have you proceed as it is.

01:16:47.920 --> 01:16:50.980
You gave me the money as you wished, didn't you?

01:16:51.530 --> 01:16:52.490
I-Idiot!

01:16:52.930 --> 01:16:54.920
I can't carry the ship as it is!

01:16:55.200 --> 01:16:57.810
Even you know that, don't you?

01:16:58.050 --> 01:16:59.630
You risked your life...

01:17:00.800 --> 01:17:13.630
For me, how many days have passed?

01:17:14.090 --> 01:17:23.100
In the consciousness of being lost, the voice of that girl, the figure of that girl is revived.

01:17:24.300 --> 01:17:27.980
And then, she appeared in front of me.

01:17:30.320 --> 01:17:33.440
The God of the Asgard continent guides me.

01:17:35.270 --> 01:17:36.270
This is my destiny.

01:17:37.560 --> 01:17:38.020
Destiny?

01:17:40.220 --> 01:17:41.000
That young man.

01:17:41.200 --> 01:17:43.180
The man who was guided by a bizarre destiny.

01:17:44.480 --> 01:17:46.960
And the sudden separation.

01:17:48.230 --> 01:17:52.700
In order to verify my feelings for the girl who was deeply engraved in my heart...

01:17:54.350 --> 01:17:57.820
There is everything in the valley of illusion.

01:17:58.080 --> 01:17:59.750
My...

01:18:00.120 --> 01:18:01.060
Everything I've ever wanted...

01:18:01.060 --> 01:18:02.860
Don't mess with me!

01:18:02.920 --> 01:18:08.430
Throwing away my house, my family, and the woman I've been looking for!

01:18:09.250 --> 01:18:10.570
How pathetic.

01:18:11.570 --> 01:18:13.110
You're an interesting old man, aren't you?

01:18:13.310 --> 01:18:13.650
What?

01:18:13.890 --> 01:18:15.390
I think you're better than my old man, who only has money and emotions.

01:18:18.430 --> 01:18:20.380
I like it.

01:18:20.600 --> 01:18:22.010
This is how you live.

01:18:22.450 --> 01:18:22.630
Mr.

01:18:34.640 --> 01:18:35.980
You still don't have any clues?

01:18:36.740 --> 01:18:39.000
Yes. I'm sorry.

01:18:39.480 --> 01:18:44.340
It's not your fault. Don't worry about it.

01:18:44.900 --> 01:18:47.660
I'm still dreaming.

01:18:48.360 --> 01:18:52.740
When I go to school, I always wait at the station.

01:18:53.090 --> 01:18:54.900
Hitomi runs to me.

01:18:55.020 --> 01:18:56.080
Good morning.

01:18:56.460 --> 01:18:58.980
But I always wake up there.

01:19:02.200 --> 01:19:02.480
It's me.

01:19:02.640 --> 01:19:06.470
I'm also dreaming of Hitomi.

01:19:06.690 --> 01:19:07.130
Huh?

01:19:10.990 --> 01:19:11.790
She's doing well.

01:19:12.590 --> 01:19:16.940
She must be having a hard time, but...

01:19:16.940 --> 01:19:18.500
If it's her...

01:19:18.500 --> 01:19:18.720
See?

01:19:26.330 --> 01:19:27.910
It's the ocean all the way to the front!

01:19:28.050 --> 01:19:28.390
See?

01:19:30.090 --> 01:19:31.070
It's straight as it is.

01:19:31.170 --> 01:19:33.150
Dryden says it's in this direction.

01:19:33.850 --> 01:19:35.660
Can you trust him?

01:19:36.180 --> 01:19:37.640
The captain says it's good.

01:19:38.160 --> 01:19:39.440
I have no choice but to do it.

01:19:39.720 --> 01:19:42.430
Pyle, how about you?

01:19:43.100 --> 01:19:44.160
It'll take a little longer.

01:19:44.600 --> 01:19:46.340
It seems that it will take time to install all the parts from Dryden's Gaimerf.

01:19:50.460 --> 01:19:52.200
Besides, it doesn't fit well.

01:19:52.540 --> 01:19:53.500
It's a screw.

01:19:53.980 --> 01:19:55.100
Hey, don't break it.

01:19:55.500 --> 01:19:56.060
I'm waiting.

01:19:58.130 --> 01:19:59.690
Blue 16th Moon.

01:20:00.700 --> 01:20:04.100
A gust of wind and a steep cliff blocked the way.

01:20:04.780 --> 01:20:07.040
It was as if they were trying to challenge a mystery.

01:20:08.240 --> 01:20:11.110
But then...

01:20:11.110 --> 01:20:15.810
I met an old man alone.

01:20:16.070 --> 01:20:22.520
I believed in the existence of an illusion valley, and there were others who were traveling in search of it.

01:20:24.760 --> 01:20:27.720
Isaac, the old man, answered.

01:20:34.000 --> 01:20:39.630
I haven't talked to anyone until now, but maybe it's better to talk to someone.

01:20:40.250 --> 01:20:45.320
I've heard a story from my mother a long time ago.

01:20:45.660 --> 01:20:59.220
Yes, when I was about the same age as Hitomi, on the way home from the summer festival, I was surrounded by狩り and arrived at a world I had never seen before.

01:21:00.000 --> 01:21:07.580
The story of Isaac is very interesting.

01:21:08.200 --> 01:21:11.050
He was also looking for an illusion valley.

01:21:12.170 --> 01:21:14.320
He was looking for the mystery of Atlantis.

01:21:14.320 --> 01:21:22.440
And surprisingly, Isaac came from the moon of illusion, just like that girl.

01:21:30.380 --> 01:21:31.540
I'm the same as you.

01:21:31.740 --> 01:21:33.140
This is...

01:21:36.650 --> 01:21:36.790
Mi?

01:21:36.830 --> 01:21:39.170
This is my mother.

01:22:16.540 --> 01:22:17.060
That person...

01:22:56.940 --> 01:22:57.860
This is the person of the phantom moon.

01:23:00.190 --> 01:23:01.490
I set out on this journey in order to cut off all ties.

01:23:03.830 --> 01:23:09.970
However, when I look into your eyes, even that seems futile.

01:23:10.430 --> 01:23:14.140
Will you forgive me?

01:23:39.880 --> 01:23:52.260
I have come to ask for the permission of Adelphos General D'Landu to return to his country.

01:23:53.040 --> 01:23:59.960
Hmph, permission from a sorcerer. He is my subordinate.

01:24:00.000 --> 01:24:02.920
It's a strange story, but it was originally a soldier that you magicians sent.

01:24:03.880 --> 01:24:06.780
For the time being, let's hear the reason.

01:24:07.360 --> 01:24:11.330
It's a disease. I got a message from the soldier Falken.

01:24:13.690 --> 01:24:17.370
That demon is sick. It's unusual.

01:24:18.710 --> 01:24:23.540
If you understand, I will send you to General Adelphos.

01:24:31.660 --> 01:24:34.890
It's getting more and more unstable.

01:24:36.080 --> 01:24:38.840
The fate-shaping experiment wasn't complete.

01:24:39.780 --> 01:24:40.860
There's no Tolkien.

01:24:41.660 --> 01:24:43.210
I know.

01:24:43.590 --> 01:24:54.370
I won't give up like this.

01:24:54.430 --> 01:24:59.590
After I return to my home country, I'll try again.

01:25:00.000 --> 01:25:13.030
They are heading to the land of phantoms.

01:25:13.200 --> 01:25:16.460
Legend of phantoms?

01:25:18.690 --> 01:25:23.110
The land of phantoms.

01:25:23.110 --> 01:25:25.710
The village of friends.

01:25:25.710 --> 01:25:27.870
The land of phantoms.

01:25:32.170 --> 01:25:37.600
At the end of the third month, Isaac and I finally arrived at the Nome.

01:25:39.230 --> 01:25:43.070
I'm sure there will be a village of phantoms ahead of us.

01:25:44.670 --> 01:25:48.010
Before I knew it, Isaac was gone.

01:25:48.560 --> 01:25:51.470
Did I get separated from him in this deep fog?

01:25:53.680 --> 01:25:59.750
Or am I a phantom?

01:26:00.000 --> 01:26:02.360
All you have to do is think about going to the valley of phantoms.

01:26:02.620 --> 01:26:08.390
If you go to the valley of phantoms, the mystery of Atlantis will be solved.

01:26:08.510 --> 01:26:13.190
Then you'll be able to meet that girl again.

01:26:13.910 --> 01:26:18.110
If I meet that girl, I'll...

01:26:18.110 --> 01:26:23.340
Are you running away?

01:26:23.800 --> 01:26:28.260
It's interesting that you, the Knight of the Sky, are confused by this.

01:26:32.330 --> 01:26:34.110
I don't think I can fall in love with you.

01:26:36.780 --> 01:26:39.800
That's good. I don't feel the same way.

01:26:40.240 --> 01:26:42.880
Mr. Dryden, I think it's terrible.

01:26:47.290 --> 01:26:50.510
I wonder if Kawaii-ko-chan hates me again.

01:27:00.350 --> 01:27:00.910
Allen-san...

01:27:00.910 --> 01:27:02.610
Hitomi...

01:27:02.610 --> 01:27:03.010
Yes?

01:27:03.600 --> 01:27:05.920
I've shown you something embarrassing.

01:27:06.720 --> 01:27:09.820
That's not true. I...

01:27:09.820 --> 01:27:11.990
I can't forgive him...

01:27:11.990 --> 01:27:13.930
I can't forgive my father...

01:27:14.510 --> 01:27:17.100
For abandoning his family...

01:27:17.100 --> 01:27:18.810
I don't think that's right.

01:27:20.220 --> 01:27:21.220
Because, Allen-san...

01:27:21.220 --> 01:27:23.690
You had your father's will, didn't you?

01:27:23.970 --> 01:27:29.620
Even abandoning...

01:27:30.000 --> 01:27:32.760
Allen didn't do that.

01:27:33.080 --> 01:27:37.570
Because he wanted to know about his father somewhere.

01:27:38.130 --> 01:27:40.260
Allen is a kind person.

01:27:40.660 --> 01:27:43.090
He shouldn't hate people so much.

01:27:43.570 --> 01:27:46.980
If Allen's feelings are really deep,

01:27:47.520 --> 01:27:51.360
I don't think everyone will like Allen.

01:27:52.960 --> 01:27:59.070
You think you want to forgive your father, don't you?

01:28:00.030 --> 01:28:01.270
I might have been scared.

01:28:02.210 --> 01:28:07.600
I might not have wanted to admit the fact that my father had abandoned me somewhere.

01:28:09.800 --> 01:28:16.470
Are you sure you'll forgive me if I were Hitomi?

01:28:17.580 --> 01:28:24.390
It's almost time for you to get rid of me.

01:28:24.930 --> 01:28:27.340
I'll go take a look.

01:28:27.400 --> 01:28:28.630
Meruru, stay here.

01:28:49.450 --> 01:28:50.230
I'll fly all the way to the top!

01:28:50.430 --> 01:28:52.910
Riden, keep an eye on the front!

01:28:53.030 --> 01:28:54.450
If you use it, you'll be in trouble!

01:28:55.040 --> 01:28:55.220
Yeah!

01:29:13.240 --> 01:29:14.460
I didn't know he was here.

01:29:14.700 --> 01:29:16.180
He should be here soon.

01:29:16.480 --> 01:29:19.400
Let's go to the

01:29:19.400 --> 01:29:20.060
Kyoumei Ukihiro!

01:29:20.180 --> 01:29:20.940
Let's go, Torikaji!

01:29:21.880 --> 01:29:22.160
Alright!

01:29:22.760 --> 01:29:28.180
Hang in there!

01:29:28.340 --> 01:29:29.240
You're almost there!

01:29:30.120 --> 01:29:30.320
Yes!

01:29:30.480 --> 01:29:39.020
Is that still the village of illusion?

01:29:39.520 --> 01:29:55.880
Is that still the village of illusion?

01:29:56.120 --> 01:29:58.110
There's nothing there, is there?

01:29:58.350 --> 01:29:58.630
No.

01:30:00.120 --> 01:30:00.880
What the hell is that?

01:30:00.880 --> 01:30:02.870
What's going on?

01:30:03.150 --> 01:30:04.400
The page is broken!

01:30:05.080 --> 01:30:05.950
It's a disaster!

01:30:06.250 --> 01:30:08.570
It's the Winter Fortress of Zaiba!

01:30:08.570 --> 01:30:09.590
Damn it!

01:30:09.610 --> 01:30:13.160
Astoria Expressway, confirmed!

01:30:13.520 --> 01:30:14.480
All right.

01:30:14.520 --> 01:30:17.800
Narya, Elia, can you hear me?

01:30:18.320 --> 01:30:19.480
Yes, Lord Falken.

01:30:19.700 --> 01:30:20.960
We can go anytime.

01:30:21.840 --> 01:30:23.600
We will always be your brothers.

01:30:23.700 --> 01:30:25.490
Thank you.

01:30:38.320 --> 01:30:40.210
Elia, I know who they are.

01:30:40.210 --> 01:30:45.820
I'm sure it's them.

01:30:47.840 --> 01:30:48.360
They took the top floor.

01:30:48.580 --> 01:30:49.950
They're trying to get us in.

01:30:50.210 --> 01:30:51.860
Ile, what about Serazada?

01:30:52.460 --> 01:30:58.370
I don't know.

01:30:58.870 --> 01:30:59.670
I don't know for sure.

01:31:00.000 --> 01:31:06.570
I know. If you always think strongly, you can have this.

01:31:07.510 --> 01:31:14.100
Then, show me the valley of illusion.

01:31:14.360 --> 01:31:23.080
I want to see the valley of illusion.

01:31:23.480 --> 01:31:27.720
Mother, what did you do to me?

01:31:30.000 --> 01:31:31.200
I won't let you get away with this!

01:31:31.240 --> 01:31:36.180
I will settle this with you, Father, in the Valley of Illusion!

01:31:45.710 --> 01:31:48.060
What will you do in the Valley of Illusion?

01:32:43.920 --> 01:32:49.930
Come stand up, eh.

01:33:02.880 --> 01:33:03.140
Stop.

01:33:41.708 --> 01:33:42.568
Skafron

01:33:44.364 --> 01:33:45.164
Stop it!
